OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAControversial Orange Order march
OL,4,Ato go ahead for first time in nearly 30
OL,5,Ayears after late night drama
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Drumcree parade, which in the 1990s
OL,8,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,9,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,10,Fhad been given permission to go ahead
OL,11,Falong the Garvaghy Road with
OL,12,Frestrictions in place.
OL,14,FHowever that decision was challenged in
OL,15,Fseveral Belfast courts on Saturday,
OL,16,Fbefore finally being given the go ahead
OL,17,Fjust hours before it is due to take
OL,18,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
